Run the pidfd collection on gVisor's supported namespaces and devices.
Time namespaces are not implemented (b/491161640), and /dev/kmsg is absent.
The recycled-PID check takes long enough to exceed the integration test's
15-minute deadline before gVisor's PID allocator wraps.

